<div class="modal teams" id="one">
  <div class="modal-dialog modal-lg shadow">
    <div class="modal-content shadow">

      <!-- Modal Header -->
      <div class="modal-header">
        <span class="modal-title text-uppercase">Board of Director</span>
        <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal">&times;</button>
      </div>

      <!-- Modal body -->
      <div class="modal-body">
        <div class="media  p-3">
  <!--<img src="https://naiknavare.com/assets/img/dp-naiknavare.jpg" alt="" class="border mr-3 mt-0 rounded-circle mb-2">-->
  <img src="https://naiknavare.com/assets/img/dp-naiknavare.jpg" alt="D.P. Naiknavare " class="border mr-3 mt-0 rounded-circle mb-2">
  <div class="media-body">
    <span class="mb-0 lead font-weight-bold"> Late D. P. NAIKNAVARE</span>
    <small>Chairman Emeritus | B.E. (Mechanical and Electrical)</small>
    <hr class="text-justify">
     <p class="mb-2">Teacher, Manager, Technocrat, Entrepreneur and Chief Mentor, Shri D.P. Naiknavare - Dadasaheb donned many hats. In an illustrious career spanning over six decades, Dadasaheb, a Mechanical & Electrical engineer, worked with several top-notch engineering firms. Not one to sit idle, after his retirement from Dodsal in 1985, he started Naiknavare Developers, along with his two sons and daughter-in-law. The first project in Pune was Prashanta, a single building with only 17 flats. Since then, his vision and guidance assisted the company in moving into diverse areas such as hospitality, manufacturing, education, etc.</p>
<p>A patient listener with a kind word for all, Dadasaheb was the man to go to when faced with challenges.</p>
  </div>
</div>
       
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="modal teams" id="two">
  <div class="modal-dialog modal-lg shadow">
    <div class="modal-content shadow">

      <!-- Modal Header -->
      <div class="modal-header">
        <span class="modal-title text-uppercase">SENIOR MANAGEMENT</span>
        <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal">&times;</button>
      </div>

      <!-- Modal body -->
      <div class="modal-body">
        <div class="media  p-3">
  <img src="https://naiknavare.com/assets/img/gauri-naiknavare.jpg" alt="" class="border mr-3 mt-0 rounded-circle mb-2">
  <div class="media-body ">
    <span class="mb-0 lead font-weight-bold">GAURI NAIKNAVARE</span>
    <small>Chief Architect</small>
    <hr class="text-justify">
    <p class="mb-2">As Gauri says - "Space touches every aspect of our lives. Its impact on life is all-encompassing, be it the comfort of a home, efficiency in the office, recreation, shopping or space to learn and grow." As an architect, Gauri is on a constant quest to ensure that the relationship between these spaces and the lives ensconced in or around us, feel truly enriched. With 'Better Living, For All' as the dictum, a lens through which she envisions every project and each minute detail involved, she is committed to ensuring that the experience is rewarding.
</p><p class="">
Keeping customers at the heart of all that she does, all her initiatives focus on enhancing the life of every customer. Extremely fit, thanks to a strict exercise regime, Gauri finds it easy to walk ten flights of stairs with her site engineers to ensure that nothing is amiss. Her spirit of adventure has led her on to Kailasa Manasarovar, a physically and mentally challenging trek and travel across the globe. </p>
  </div>
</div>
       
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="modal teams" id="three">
  <div class="modal-dialog modal-lg shadow">
    <div class="modal-content shadow">

      <!-- Modal Header -->
      <div class="modal-header">
        <span class="modal-title text-uppercase">Board of Director</span>
        <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal">&times;</button>
      </div>

      <!-- Modal body -->
      <div class="modal-body">
        <div class="media  p-3">
  <img src="https://naiknavare.com/assets/img/hemant-naiknavare.jpg" alt="" class="border mr-3 mt-0 rounded-circle mb-2">
  <div class="media-body ">
    <span class="mb-0 lead font-weight-bold">HEMANT NAIKNAVARE</span>
    <small>Director | B.E. (Civil), LL.B.</small>
    <hr class="text-justify">
    <p class="mb-2">'With the tenacity of an institution building entrepreneur, Hemant led the company through the tough opening decades. The things that make him different from other people are his patience, his persistence and his sense of fair play.'</p>
<p class="mb-2">A self-professed 'learner for life', Hemant is a qualified Civil Engineer and a law graduate. Hemant brings on board his unique vision, management practices and focused approach to the functioning, expansion, diversification and management of the organization. As an integral part of the key management, he manages a portfolio that spans across HR & Business Process, Land and Legal Aspects, Project Conceptualization, Slum Rehabilitation & Education. His creative instinct, customer focus and a long term sense of market needs have been vital to the company’s growth. </p>
<p>Hemant is an ex-President of CREDAI, Pune Metro. He is actively involved as a trustee in the activities of the Sadhana trust.</p>
  </div>
</div>
       
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

