<p class="">
Ranjit believes that service is the key differentiator that draws customers to Naiknavare. Passionate about CSR, he is on the board of several NGOs and a Vice President of CREDAI (Pune), thus being actively involved in creating a better future. A weekend golfer, he strictly plays by the book on the greens as well as off it.</p>
