  <img src="https://naiknavare.com/assets/img/neel-naiknavare.jpg" alt="" class="border mr-3 mt-0 rounded-circle mb-2">
  <div class="media-body ">
    <span class="mb-0 lead font-weight-bold text-uppercase"> NEEL NAIKNAVARE</span>
    <small>GM: Team building & Operation | B.S Civil Engineering, Illinois | Specialization in Project Management</small>
    <hr class="text-justify">
    <p class="mb-2">Light-hearted, genuine, analytical, and patient, Neel has worked as a professional engineer in the US and holds a B.S. in Civil Engineering with a focus in project management from the top ranking university in the US – University of Illinois at Urbana-Champaign. </p>
    <p>Neel has joined the organization as General manager of Operations and Team Building and has taken on the colossal responsibility of creating an effective internal infrastructure of the business. His emphasis is on leveraging the human factor and technological innovation to devise strategies that create efficient business operations. He strongly believes that people are what make the organisation and has a vision to make Naiknavare a place where everyone dreams to work at. In his free time, Neel loves watching/playing football, trying different cuisines and travelling around the world.</p>
  </div>
