<p class="mb-2">With more than 12 years of experience in realty marketing, he is responsible for the planning and execution of all marketing activities. He is excellent at motivating his team to look beyond the obvious. With him at the helm, the sales department works in perfect synchronisation like a well-oiled machine.</p>
