    <hr class="text-justify">
    <p class="mb-2"><strong>Simply beautiful & beautifully simple!!!</strong> That’s her tag line for designing any of her projects at Naiknavare Developers. Senior Interior Designer - Shweta is a proud graduate of the first batch of CAID from Dr. Bhanuben Nanavati College of Architecture. She has 20 years of experience in the field & has been supported by a very strong team for more than a decade.</p>
<p class="mb-2">She realizes design ideas through a continuous and careful dialogue with structure, services, details, art, material and order along with a holistic and tectonic approach. </p>
