<p class="mb-2">Her team is passionate about creating spaces which are thoughtfully designed, beautifully crafted and artistically inclined. Functionality & detailing all go hand in hand, which is visible in each & every project designed by Shweta.</p>
<p>Her team has a diverse portfolio of designing show flats, premium residences, clubhouses, hotels, schools and commercial spaces. They constantly aim to create innovative & lively design solutions that are impressive and user friendly while keeping the customers in mind.</p>
